WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.792
An organization hierarchy is a classic recursive example.

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:08.022
We start with the root employee whose manager ID is NULL.

00:00:08.022 --> 00:00:11.352
Then we find employees who report to that root.

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:14.947
Then employees who report to those employees.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:21.322
Depth tells us the level, and a path string lets us see the route from the top of

00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:28.362
the hierarchy. Recursive CTEs are useful when rows refer to other rows in a hierarchy or graph-like chain.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:34.232
The anchor establishes the starting set; the recursive term finds the next level.

00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:37.437
Always think about termination and cycles.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:42.156
Production hierarchies often need safeguards against malformed relationships.
